  "roof_interpretation": "The two most legible editions show long roof planes parallel to the street and a short intersecting projecting slope, also visible in the independently photographed attic gable. A small pale patch is visible in multiple years. The imagery alone does not resolve its height, construction or use. Tree cover and roof relief shift the apparent outline between editions. The mapped lines mark optical breaks. They should not be taken as a surveyed parcel boundary or as elevations.",
  "model_scope": "Main historical villa. Street outlines are a reference for scale and orientation. Each neighbor, side-yard low roof and garden parcel remains separately identified.",
